OL,3,GNEWSAInside the #80m project
OL,4,Atransforming a town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe land between Telford's railway
OL,7,Fstation and busy town centre is in the
OL,8,Fclosing stages of a massive
OL,9,Ftransformation.
OL,11,FOld office blocks have been either
OL,12,Frepurposed or knocked down, and acres
OL,13,Fof derelict land are being turned into
OL,14,Fa modern housing estate, with an
OL,15,Fadjoining apartment block and hotel.
OL,17,FOnce phase one of Station Quarter is
OL,18,Fcompleted next year, the #80m
OL,19,Fdevelopment will have created a new
OL,20,Ftown centre community, as well as
OL,21,Fimproved a key gateway into one of
OL,22,FEngland's fastest growing towns.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
