OL,3,GNEWSAInside the #80m project
OL,4,Atransforming a town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The pace of progress has been
OL,7,Fphenomenal," said councillor Paul
OL,8,FDavis, who's in charge of stronger
OL,9,Fcommunities and local pride on
OL,10,FLabour-run Telford and Wrekin Council.
